hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"95","[AI-translation] Hazrat Muawiyah bin Abi Sufyan (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apni walida Hind bint Utbah (Raziyallahu anha) ko kehte hue suna — jabke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka zikr kar rahi thin, kaha: 'Main ne Uhud ke din jo kiya Aap ke chacha aur Aap ke sahaba ka musla [lashon ko kaatna] kiya. Jab bhi Quraish kisi safar [jang] par chalti to main apne sath un ke sath hoti, yahan tak ke main ne khwab mein teen raaten dekha: main ne dekha goya main andhere mein hun ke na nashib dekhti hun aur na pahad. Aur main ne dekha ke wo andhera mujh se roshni se hat gaya jo us ki jagah [aayi]. To achanak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mujhe bula rahe hain. Phir main ne doosri raat dekha goya main ek raste par hun, aur achanak Hubal mere dayen mujhe bula raha hai, aur achanak Isaf mujhe mere bayen se bula raha hai, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere samne farma rahe hain: Aao idhar, is raste ki taraf aao. Phir main ne teesri raat dekha goya main jahannam ke kinare khadi hun, wo mujhe us mein dhakelna chahte hain, aur achanak Hubal keh raha hai: Us mein dakhil ho. To main ne mud kar dekha, aur achanak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere peeche mere kapde pakde hue hain. To main jahannam ke kinare se door hui, aur main ghabra gayi. Phir main ne kaha: Ye koi cheez hai jo mere liye wazeh kar di gayi hai. To subah main hamare ghar ke but ke paas gayi, phir main use marne lagi aur kehti thi: Kitne arse se main teri wajah se dhoke mein thi. Aur main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi, phir main Islam layi aur baiat ki.'"
